      "content": "thanks for the list. i was thinking about point 6 though... sometimes people argue that \"stable regulatory frameworks\" is just a fancy way of saying a ton of red tape that actually stops companies from growing and innovating. do you think heavy regulation usually helps or hinders that kind of rapid growth you mentioned?",
